[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]What is LocoPillars?[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[B]LocoPillars[/B] is a feature-complete, production-ready [B]Pillars of Fortune[/B] server plugin. Players spawn in isolated cages, get released into the arena, and compete to build the tallest pillar while fighting off every other player. Last one standing wins.

Under the hood it runs [B]multi-instance arena management[/B], [B]fully scriptable LuckyBlocks[/B], a [B]drag-and-drop cosmetics shop[/B], [B]27+ achievements[/B], a [B]per-player stats database[/B], [B]100+ PlaceholderAPI placeholders[/B], and an [B]in-game map editor[/B]. All configurable without touching a single line of code.


