[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Admin Editor (/editor)[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

LocoPillars ships with a full in-game map editor, no external tools needed.

[LIST=1]
[*]Run [ICODE]/editor setup[/ICODE] for the guided quick-setup wizard.
[*]Use [ICODE]/editor create <name>[/ICODE] to start a new arena.
[*]Place cage spawn points with the hotbar tools ([ICODE]/editor hotbar[/ICODE]).
[*]Import WorldEdit / FAWE schematics and attach them to the arena.
[*]Run [ICODE]/editor validate[/ICODE] to catch configuration errors.
[*]Save with [ICODE]/editor save[/ICODE] and the arena is immediately available in-game.
[/LIST]

Supports [B]multiple schematics per arena[/B], schematic resizing, and live hotbar-based spawn-point editing, all without leaving the game.


