[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_map_name%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Map display name[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_world%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]World name of the game instance[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_players_in_game%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Current player count[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_players_max%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Maximum players[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_players_min%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Minimum players to start[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_timer%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Game timer in seconds[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_timer_string%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Game timer as MM:SS[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_lobby_timer%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Lobby countdown in seconds[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_items_timer%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Seconds until next item drop[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_active_games%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total active games on the server[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]
[/SPOILER]

[SPOILER="Teams"]
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Placeholder[/TH]
[TH]Returns[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_team_name%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]The player's team name[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_team_color%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]The player's team color[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_team_size%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]The player's team size[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_teams_total%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total number of teams in the game[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_teams_names%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All team names, comma-separated[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_teams_colors%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All team colors, comma-separated[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_teams_sizes%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All team sizes, comma-separated[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

Replace [ICODE]team1[/ICODE] with team1, team2, team3, etc.:

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Placeholder[/TH]
[TH]Returns[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_team_team1_displayname%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Team display name[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_team_team1_status_symbol%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Status: alive / eliminated / warning / empty[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_team_team1_players_alive%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Players still alive in the team[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_team_team1_players_total%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total team players[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_game_team_team1_players_dead%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Eliminated team players[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]
[/SPOILER]

[SPOILER="Maps & Server"]
Replace [ICODE]<mapname>[/ICODE] with the map's folder name (e.g. [ICODE]arena1[/ICODE]):

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Placeholder[/TH]
[TH]Returns[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_players_in_lobby%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Players in lobby for this map[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_players_playing%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Players currently in a game on this map[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_players_total%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total players (lobby + in-game) for this map[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_games_active%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Active game instances on this map[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_games_waiting%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Waiting game instances[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_games_starting%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Starting game instances[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_map_<mapname>_games_total%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total instances for this map[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_online_players%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total online players[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_player_name%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Shorthand for the player's name[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]
[/SPOILER]

[SPOILER="Achievements"]
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Placeholder[/TH]
[TH]Returns[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_total_count%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Total achievements available[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_total_completed_amount%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Achievements unlocked by this player[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_total_completed_percent%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Completion percentage[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

Replace [ICODE]<id>[/ICODE] with the achievement ID (e.g. [ICODE]first_win[/ICODE]):

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Placeholder[/TH]
[TH]Returns[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_completed%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]1 if unlocked, 0 if not[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_progress%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Raw progress value[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_percent%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Progress as a percentage[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_name%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Achievement name[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_description%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Achievement description[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_difficulty%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]EASY / NORMAL / HARD / EXTREME[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_category%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Achievement category[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<id>_type%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Achievement type[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<category>_category_status%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Percentage of a category completed[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]%locopillars_achievement_<difficulty>_difficulty_status%[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Percentage of a difficulty tier completed[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]
[/SPOILER]


[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Requirements & Dependencies[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Dependency[/TH]
[TH]Type[/TH]
[TH]Notes[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]Paper[/TD]
[TD]Server[/TD]
[TD]1.21+[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]WorldEdit or FastAsyncWorldEdit[/TD]
[TD]Required[/TD]
[TD]Auto-detected at startup[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]PlaceholderAPI[/TD]
[TD]Required[/TD]
[TD]2.11+[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]TAB[/TD>
[TD]Optional[/TD]
[TD]5.2+, enhanced player list[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]ProtocolLib[/TD]
[TD]Optional[/TD]
[TD]5.4+, tab visibility management[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]Vault[/TD]
[TD]Optional[/TD]
[TD]1.7+, economy reward integration[/TD]
[/TR]
[TR]
[TD]ItemsAdder[/TD]
[TD]Optional[/TD]
[TD]3.6+, custom cosmetic item textures[/TD]
[/TR]
[/TABLE]


[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Permissions[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]Players (default: true)[/B][/SIZE]
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.pillars.*[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All /pillars subcommands[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locoPillars.play[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Join and play games[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.spawn[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Teleport to lobby[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.use[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Send chat messages[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.teamchat[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Use team chat[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.hideme[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Hide yourself from others[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.hideothers[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Hide other players[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.showothers[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Show a specific player[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.achievements.use[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Use achievement commands[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.luckyblocks.menu[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Open the LuckyBlocks menu[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[SIZE=4][B]Staff (default: op)[/B][/SIZE]
[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Permission[/TH]
[TH]Description[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.admin[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All administrative access[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.editor[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Use /editor and all map tools[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.setspawn[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Set the lobby spawn location[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.spawn.others[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Teleport other players to spawn[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.vanish[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Toggle vanish mode[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.memory.use[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Memory management commands[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.admin[/ICODE][/TD][TD]All chat administration[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.socialspy[/ICODE][/TD][TD]View all player chat[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.bypass-cooldown[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Skip chat cooldown[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.chat.bypass-filter[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Skip profanity filter[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.achievements.admin[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Administer achievements[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.luckyblocks.getluckyblock[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Get a LuckyBlock via command[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.notify.update[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Receive in-game update notifications[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]locopillars.tab[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Reload TAB configuration[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]


[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Database[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

Set in [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE], no code changes needed.

[TABLE]
[TR]
[TH]Backend[/TH]
[TH]Notes[/TH]
[/TR]
[TR][TD]H2[/TD][TD]Default, embedded, zero setup[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]MySQL[/TD][TD]Recommended for production / network servers[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]MariaDB[/TD][TD]Fully supported[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]PostgreSQL[/TD][TD]Fully supported[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

All backends use HikariCP connection pooling.


[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Configuration[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

[CODE]plugins/LocoPillars/
├── config.yml              Main settings (database, arenas, chat, scoreboard, TAB)
├── language.yml            All player-facing messages
├── items.yml               GUI item definitions
├── Games/
│   └── <GameType>.yml      Per-game-type config (timers, build limits, rewards, teams)
├── Achievements/
│   └── <id>.yml            One file per achievement
├── Cosmetics/
│   ├── cages/<name>/       Settings.json
│   ├── kill/<name>/        Settings.json + Cosmetic.kts
│   ├── death/<name>/       Settings.json + Cosmetic.kts
│   └── win/<name>/         Settings.json + Cosmetic.kts
├── Luckyblocks/
│   └── <name>/             Settings.json + Luckyblock.kts
└── modules/
    └── voting/
        └── <name>/         settings.json + script.kts[/CODE]


[SIZE=6][B][COLOR=#00AF5C]Automatic Update Checker[/COLOR][/B][/SIZE]

LocoPillars checks Modrinth on startup for new releases. Staff with the [ICODE]locopillars.notify.update[/ICODE] permission receive an in-game notification when an update is available. Can be disabled in [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE].


